; hello.tys — optional authoring surface (NON-NORMATIVE convenience)
; Vote: docs/ROLE-DEBATE-EMITTER-VS-READABLE.md
; Law remains Layer-S `.ty` after deterministic desugar (profile tys-hello-v1).
; DDC / lock MUST NOT treat this file as compare truth.
;
; Desugar: scripts/check-sugar.mjs → yoyo/examples/hello.expected.ty
; (stock_gui-shaped: 40 10 / named slots / loop / FF)

HANDLER entry:
  SET i 0
  SET n 5
  SET sum 0

HANDLER loop:
  CMP i n
  JZ done
  INC sum
  INC i
  JMP loop

HANDLER done:
  RET
